sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant V as harness-verify
    participant M as context-memory
    participant MI as "MASTER_INDEX.md"
    participant A as Feature + Session Inputs
    participant F as Memory Files
    participant CM as "skills/context-memory/SKILL.md"
    participant E as Session Extracts
    participant S as Feature Status
    participant P as Promotion Proposal

    V->>V: Verdict = Pass and verified: true
    V->>E: Append ## Post-Ship Sync record
    V->>S: skill-exit sets status = Done
    V->>M: Invoke post-ship knowledge sweep (/context-memory)
    Note over M: Failed / advisory verified:false skips Done

    M->>MI: Enumerate current memory file set
    alt MASTER_INDEX.md missing
        M-->>V: STOP — repair MASTER_INDEX.md before sweeping
    end

    M->>A: Read feature specification, plan, extracts, and ADR evidence
    A-->>M: Durable changes, candidates, ADR evidence

    alt Extremely Narrow change
        M->>F: Sweep learned heuristics only
    else Moderate / Core change
        loop For each file listed in MASTER_INDEX.md
            M->>F: Read memory file
            alt Durable change found
                M->>F: Apply Update
                Note over M,F: Update the appropriate domain boundary file
                M->>M: Distill and deduplicate learned heuristics
                M->>M: Check promotion thresholds in core-policies.md
                alt Threshold crossed
                    M->>CM: Add promotion watchlist entry
                    M->>P: Write a promotion proposal
                    Note over P: Proposal only and never automatic promotion
                end
            else No change needed
                M->>M: Record Untouched with concrete 1-line reason
            else Domain load condition unmet
                M->>M: Record Skipped (domain files only)
            end
        end
    end

    M->>E: Mark candidates triaged and update post-ship sync
    M->>M: Verify evidence-backed updates and concrete reasons

    alt Sweep verification passes
        M-->>V: OK — sync record complete
    else Generic skip or gaps found
        M-->>V: REJECT — require explicit concrete reasons
    end

    Note over V,P: Scope promotion and stop rules are owned by context-memory
